    {
      "kind": "kartaview",
      "walls": [
        3,
        4,
        8
      ],
      "frame": "373917296",
      "note": "Wing windows occupy about three fifths of each floor-to-floor height. The narrow end-wall lights line up vertically. The central entry has taller glazing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "lidar",
      "note": "Across the entrance block, the central roof is about 7.8 m above datum. Equipment courts on either side read 6.2–6.4 m. The southeast plot beyond the court drops to ground level."
    }
  ],
  "notes": "The porch soffit folds into triangular facets between the columns. Narrow stones vary considerably in length and tone. The southern elevations face downslope and their exact window spacing is inferred."
